<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA- TALLINNA LEASING SYNDICATED LOAN PLACING STARTS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA- TALLINNA LEASING SYNDICATED LOAN PLACING STARTS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Bank has started the subscription period for Tallinna Panga Liising's syndicated loan of 25 million marks, the leasing company said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The interest rate for the syndicated loan is DM LIBOR plus a margin of 90 basis points, the company's council head Priit Poldoja told Reuters.</p>
<p>The interest rate will fall by ten basis points if Estonia gets an investment rating grade, he added.</p>
<p>The placing will end on August 29.</p>
<p>Tallinna Panga Liising is the leasing arm of Estonia's fourth largest bank Tallinna Pank .</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
